{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$g''$ is the *second derivative* of $g$. In other words, it's the derivative of $g'$, which is the derivative of $g$.\n\nTherefore, in order to find $g''(x)$, we need to differentiate $g$ twice.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $g'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ng'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\dfrac{5}{x}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{5}{x^2}\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\ng'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\dfrac{5}{x}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-5x^{-1}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-5\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[x^{-1}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-5\\left(-x^{-2}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5x^{-2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{5}{x^2}\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"Now we can differentiate $g'$ to find $g''(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ng''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{5}{x^2}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{10}{x^3}\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\ng''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{5}{x^2}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[5x^{-2}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[x^{-2}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5\\left(-2x^{-3}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-10x^{-3}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{10}{x^3}\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"In conclusion, $g''(x)=-\\dfrac{10}{x^3}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $g(x)=-\\dfrac{5}{x}$.\n\n**Find $g''(x)$.**\n\n$g''(x)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":"0","simplify":false,"value":"-\\frac{10}{x^{3}}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"static":false,"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
